  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_agg",
  "prompt": "Which 3 stores sold the most multi-unit order lines in 2025? A multi-unit line is an order line with units of 2 or more; a line with missing units is not one. Use the sales table and count only order lines with an order_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, both days included; the webshop, WEB-01, counts as a store. Return two columns, in this order: store_code and multi_unit_lines, the number of multi-unit lines. Sort by multi_unit_lines from high to low, then by store_code from A to Z, and return the first 3 rows.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "store_code",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "multi_unit_lines",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": "one row per store_code"
  },
  "rules": {
    "order_matters": true,
    "sort_keys": [
      {
        "column": "multi_unit_lines",
        "desc": true
      },
      {
        "column": "store_code",
        "desc": false
      }
    ],
    "check_names": false,
    "allow_extra_columns": false,
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "store_code",
        "type_class": "text",
        "precision": "exact"
      },
      {
        "name": "multi_unit_lines",
        "type_class": "numeric",
        "precision": "count"
      }
    ],
    "strict_temporal_type": false,
    "trim_strings": false,
    "tie_policy": "none",
    "key_columns": [
      "store_code"
    ],
    "timeout_ms": 5000,
    "set_semantics": false,
    "case_insensitive": false,
    "strict_column_order": false
  },
  "hints": [
    "Next, write the calculated column multi_unit_lines, which counts only the lines of 2 or more units.",
    "Count with SUM of a CASE that gives 1 for units of 2 or more. Then sort on that count from high to low, add store_code from A to Z as the tie-break, and keep 3 rows."
  ],
